> (report! desktop v 200 0 #f)
> (report! desktop v 1 0 #f)
> (run desktop views:scroll-down)
! views:scroll-down: beginning of buffer
; Work no client did places every client.
> (views:scroll-to! v (line-start v 10) (views:align top))
> (list (placement v desktop) (placement v phone))
((new top 10) (new top 10))
; The total height stays until a report at rest, so a drag of the
; scroll bar's thumb follows the pointer.
> (report! desktop v 10 0 #f)
> (drawn v desktop)
(1 70 70 () (6036))
